        "why_justification": "Every flagged line's deal, source and single precedence-assigned finding are graded, so a trusted partner type, a case-sensitive or gross ledger join, an out-of-window or pending override applied, or a duplicate missed shows on the lines it moves. Entailed by: \"One row per flagged line, keyed by `line_id` ... `finding_code` is the single finding the policy's precedence rule assigns to the line\"",
        "tag": "core"
      },
